        "content": {
          "attachments": {},
          "contentMode": "map",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": "",
          "markdown": "**The Mer de Glace flows north from the Mont Blanc massif toward Chamonix.**\n\nWe are looking south, up the glacier. The line is its outline in 2022.\n\nScroll to go back to 1967 and come forward again, one outline at a time.\n",
